&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may be eligible for a stipend to subsidize relocation costs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Level and base salary will be determined on a case-by-case basis and may vary based on the following considerations: job-related knowledge and skills, education, and experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Base salary is just one component of our total rewards package at Rocket Lab. Our comprehensive benefits package includes our industry-leading Employee Stock Purchase Program (with a 15% discount on company stock), top-tier medical plans (HMO, PPO, and a zero cost HDHP option with a significant HSA company contribution), dental and vision coverage, paid vacation and sick time, 11 paid holidays, flexible spending and dependent care accounts, paid parental leave, disability and life insurance, and a 401(k) retirement plan with company match.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Additional perks include subsidized EV charging, onsite fitness centers (where available), discounted gym memberships, complimentary snacks and beverages, 50% employee discount on our popular merch store, and a variety of other employee discounts.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Eligibility for benefits may vary based on employment status, please check with your recruiter for a comprehensive list of the benefits available for this role. Benefit programs are subject to change at the company’s discretion.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Hourly Pay Range (CA Only)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$25 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to unlock the potential of space to improve life on Earth, but that’s not an easy task. It takes hard work, determination, relentless innovation, teamwork, grit, and an unwavering commitment to achieving what others often deem impossible. Our people out-think, out-work, and out-pace. We pride ourselves on having each other’s backs, checking our egos at the door, and rolling up our sleeves on all tasks big and small. We thrive under pressure, work to tight deadlines, and our focus is always on how we can deliver, rather than dwelling on the challenges that stand in the way.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Important information:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOR CANDIDATES SEEKING TO WORK IN US OFFICES ONLY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To conform to U.S. Government space technology export regulations, including the International Traffic in Arms Regulations (ITAR), Rocket Lab Employees must be a U.S. citizen, lawful U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State and/or the U.S. Department of Commerce, as applicable. Learn more about ITAR &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.us/v2/url?u=https-3A__www.pmddtc.state.gov_-3Fid-3Dddtc-5Fkb-5Farticle-5Fpage-26sys-5Fid-3D24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&amp;amp;d=DwMFog&amp;amp;c=N_fLK0KxmM34zjMadXHMx_SQYmXWO3FX0MRVr1hBcn4&amp;amp;r=prjnch9sxomG2ahCicblmM3m-FuPObepspoR1qvWq2I&amp;amp;m=ExC44mBPk2emo4Fr0xPSGZN0UraQ1ZtkDTxwR7iWw5rixcFQb-Wjlv7lJcecLldz&amp;amp;s=0lfm4LyRtFwK220WHBK11DGHWSVvVhQEcfa5G_2Nf18&amp;amp;e=&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Rocket Lab provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment at Rocket Lab, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applicants requiring a reasonable accommodation for the application/interview process for a job in the United States should contact Giulia Johnson at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:g.biow@rocketlabusa.com&quot;&gt;g.biow@rocketlabusa.com.&lt;/a&gt;This dedicated resource is intended solely to assist job seekers with disabilities whose disability prevents them from being able to apply/interview. Only messages left for this purpose will be considered. A response to your request may take up to two business days.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOR CANDIDATES SEEKING TO WORK IN NEW ZEALAND OFFICES ONLY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For security reasons, background checks will be undertaken prior to any employment offers being made to an applicant.&amp;nbsp; These checks will include nationality checks as it is a requirement of this position that you be eligible to access equipment and data regulated by the United States&#39; International Traffic in Arms Regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Under these Regulations, you may be ineligible for this role if you do not hold citizenship of Australia, Japan, New Zealand, Switzerland, the European Union, or a country that is part of NATO, or if you hold ineligible dual citizenship or nationality.&amp;nbsp; For more information on these Regulations, click here &lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link ___m14voj0 f3rmtva f1ern45e f1deefiw f1n71otn f1q5o8ev f1h8hb77 f1vxd6vx f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f9n3di6 f1ids18y fygtlnl f1deo86v f12x56k7 f1iescvh ftqa4ok f50u1b5 fs3pq8b f1hghxdh f1tymzes f1x7u7e9 f1cmlufx f10aw75t fsle3fq&quot; href=&quot;https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2020/01/23/2020-00574/international-traffic-in-arms-regulations-us-munitions-list-categories-i-ii-and-iii&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ITAR Regulations.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn strategy into a pipeline-generating machine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What does it take to turn business development priorities into consistent execution and measurable pipeline? As Manager, Business Development, you’ll lead, coach and develop a team of Sales Development Representatives (SDRs) and Senior SDRs, creating the focus, accountability and support they need to perform at their best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be at the heart of our Lead Generation Machine, translating priorities across inbound, outbound, field events and re-engagement into clear execution plans while continuously strengthening how the team works and grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As our Manager, Business Development, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and develop a team of SDRs and Senior SDRs, owning individual development plans and supporting progression toward increased responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own team performance across meetings, sales-accepted leads, sales-qualified leads and pipeline creation, using performance data to identify and address gaps in targeting, messaging, conversion and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Business Development priorities into clear weekly and quarterly plans, allocating team capacity across inbound, outbound, field events, re-engagement and strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive consistent execution of service-level agreements, qualification standards, operating processes and customer relationship management expectations while coaching the team on messaging, calls, account research and qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accountability for each team member’s overall performance, development and capacity, including when Senior SDRs contribute to strategic assignments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Business Development leadership, Revenue Operations, Sales, Marketing and Product Marketing to share structured feedback, strengthen execution and improve pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here is what will qualify you for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading, coaching and developing SDRs or Business Development Representatives in a business-to-business software-as-a-service environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of driving team performance against pipeline metrics, including meetings, qualified opportunities and pipeline creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate broader Business Development priorities into focused, actionable weekly and quarterly plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of prospecting and qualification fundamentals, including outbound outreach, inbound qualification, account research, messaging, customer relationship management discipline and qualification processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will make you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to develop talent, improve individual performance and prepare high performers for increased responsibilities and career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning performance data and insights into measurable improvements in targeting, messaging, conversion or execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience balancing team capacity across multiple pipeline-generation motions and strategic account initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly collaborative approach and experience partnering across Sales, Marketing, Revenue Operations and Product Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you think you can bring this role to life? Send us your application, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Coveolife!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all qualified candidates to apply regardless of, for example, age, gender, disability, gaps in CV, national or ethnic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description was written by humans, assisted by AI. We may leverage technology in our hiring process to help us see the person behind the resume.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coveo is committed to providing accessible employment practices. If you require accommodation due to a disability at any point during the recruitment process, please contact HR@Coveo.com to discuss your needs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;WHAT MAKES US EPIC?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the core of Epic’s success are talented, passionate people. Epic prides itself on creating a collaborative, welcoming, and creative environment. Whether it’s building award-winning games or crafting engine technology that enables others to make visually stunning interactive experiences, we’re always innovating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being Epic means being a part of a team that continually strives to do right by our community and users. We’re constantly innovating to raise the bar of engine and game development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;PRODUCTION&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether it’s driving a vision from start to finish or collaborating with teams to inspire and deliver projects of Epic quality, Epic’s production teams take pride in consistently delivering world-class products and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic&#39;s third-party content group brings the world&#39;s best-known entertainment and gaming IP into Fortnite as creator-enabled experiences built with Unreal Editor for Fortnite (UEFN), funding and shipping a growing slate of licensed and partner titles through external studios and vendors while operating the live platform where that content is discovered and grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the program scales with more titles, larger partnerships and major launches ahead, this role will be the production spine of that growth, leading production across the licensed IP slate end to end, coordinating delivery with internal development and platform teams, managing production relationships with licensors and external studios, and overseeing live operations once titles launch. Working alongside design, art, PM and engineering leads, you will own launch readiness, budgets, vendor contracts and capacity plans while building and leading a production team that can scale with the slate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipping and launch readiness: Own launch readiness per title, chairing weekly status across all workstreams (creator tools, island production, publishing and access, discovery placement, IP and content moderation, brand compliance, creator-facing UX, monetisation, documentation, marketing and QA), assigning owners, chasing actions and holding the quality bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner production management: Be the production face to our licensor partners, aligning on brand guidelines and content review while carrying decisions between partners, legal, business development, and the development team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform liveops: Own the live operating rhythm of the platform, including release cadence, events, merchandising, discovery and monetisation health, and the feedback loop from live metrics back into the slate and roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production team leadership: Build and run the production organisation with clear ownership, real delegation, and team ceremonies that hold up as the slate scales across UK and US timezones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget, vendors and capacity: Own vendor statements of work, budget management and annual planning, capacity and staffing plans, and org design in partnership with discipline directors, while providing senior leadership with a high-level view of people, projects, and spend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roadmap and planning: Own the production view of the roadmap across the whole organisation, keeping priorities, sequencing and resourcing aligned across teams, disciplines and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI adoption and process change: Lead the charge through a revolutionary period in game development, helping the team adopt AI where it makes a real difference, and evolve our production practices as the technology matures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience shipping games or live services from inside a first-party or internal development organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple external partners in parallel (licensors, publishers or studios), including publishing production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading live operations for a platform or live service at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience owning multi-million dollar budgets, vendor management and capacity planning, with the ability to present and defend them at the executive level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to establish production methodologies and standards that drive adoption across teams and the broader organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leader who builds effective teams, structures, and empowers others through delegation, while being able to grow a production organisation and protect team health as the slate scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm, low-ego and empathetic leader who builds trust across teams, executives and external partners, navigating ambiguity and complex challenges with clarity, sound judgment and strong communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic judgment, with the ability to see the bigger picture, navigate competing priorities, and make thoughtful trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for user-generated content and creator communities is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable collaborating closely with teams and partners across the UK and US time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;EPIC JOB + EPIC BENEFITS = EPIC LIFE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:13201,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;7&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:13421772}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;10&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Roboto&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:10}&quot;&gt;We pay 100% for benefits except for PMI (for dependents). Our current benefits package includes pension, private medical insurance, health care cash plan, dental insurance, disability and life insurance, critical illness, cycle to work scheme, flu shots, health checks, and meals. We also offer a robust mental well-being program through Modern Health, which provides free therapy and coaching for employees &amp;amp; dependents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games​ ​is a leading interactive entertainment company. For over 30 years we&#39;ve been making award-winning games and engine technology that empowers others to make visually stunning games and 3D content that bring environments to life like never before. Epic&#39;s award-winning Unreal Engine technology not only provides game developers the ability to build high-fidelity, interactive experiences for PC, console, mobile, and VR, it is also a tool being embraced by content creators across a variety of industries such as media and entertainment, automotive, and architectural design. As we continue to build our Engine technology and develop remarkable games, we strive to build teams of world-class talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Like what you hear? Come be a part of something Epic!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games deeply values diverse teams and an inclusive work culture, and we are proud to be an Equal Opportunity employer. Learn more about our Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/eeo-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note to Recruitment Agencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Epic does not accept any unsolicited resumes or approaches from any unauthorized third party (including recruitment or placement agencies) (i.e., a third party with whom we do not have a negotiated and validly executed agreement). We will not pay any fees to any unauthorized third party. Further details on these matters can be found &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/note-to-recruitment-agencies&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW262369038 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW118421231 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW118421231 BCX0&quot;&gt;Versaterm is a PE-backed, high-growth SaaS company building a fully integrated platform across the entire public safety ecosystem — dispatch, law enforcement, forensics, courts, and beyond&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW118421231 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW118421231 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW118421231 BCX0&quot;&gt;We&#39;ve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW118421231 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;grown through strategic acquisitions and deep product investment. What connects all of it is a single purpose: give public safety agencies the tools and insights to make better decisions in high-stakes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW118421231 BCX0&quot;&gt;moments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW118421231 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW262369038 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW118421231 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW51462046 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51462046 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;When a 911 call is answered, a detective investigates a case, or a forensic lab processes evidence, there&#39;s a good chance our software is working behind the scenes. That&#39;s been true for over four decades.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW262369038 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW254703803 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254703803 BCX0&quot;&gt;AI is central to where&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254703803 BCX0&quot;&gt;we&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254703803 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;going. Not as a feature but as core infrastructure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254703803 BCX0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254703803 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;embedding intelligence directly into the workflows our customers rely on every day, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254703803 BCX0&quot;&gt;we&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254703803 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;doing it alongside them. Our customers tell us what the mission demands. We build what answers it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW254703803 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW262369038 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW168861431 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW168861431 BCX0&quot;&gt;This work attracts a specific kind of person — someone who wants to be pushed by great people, build things that outlast a sprint cycle, and go home knowing the work connected back to something real.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Demand Generation Manager is responsible for driving sustainable long-term pipeline growth and market engagement across Versaterm’s portfolio of public safety solutions. This role leads high-complexity, cross-departmental initiatives through expertise and influence, and brings deep functional and technical mastery of demand generation. The Senior Demand Generation Manager frequently represents the marketing function in cross-departmental and external engagements, contributes directly to decisions that shape the direction of the area, mentors others, and actively champions Versaterm’s values across the teams and work they influence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designs and plans targeted go-to-market programs to build brand awareness and generate and nurture leads through the sales and marketing funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owns the strategy and execution of demand generation programs that drive qualified pipeline and revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defines and develops new demand generation approaches, frameworks, and best practices that raise the standard across the function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverages digital platforms to automate marketing activities, including webinars, and determines the most effective points of interaction (POI) for marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes Customer Relationship Management (CRM) systems, customer information, and marketing automation platforms like Marketo and SFDC to create and deploy effective marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own CaPDB end-to-end as the designated data owner, establishing data governance standards, quality controls, refresh cadences and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with Sales, Product, and Customer Success to guide messaging, positioning, and content strategy, ensuring go-to-market alignment, optimizing campaign performance, and supporting product launches and market expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives the creative development of content and communications that support demand generation campaigns and customer engagement, and optimizes ROI by establishing KPIs and reporting frameworks to measure campaign effectiveness and inform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads high-complexity, cross-departmental initiatives, ensuring alignment and execution against company goals and growth objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages demand generation program spend, recommending investments that maximize ROI and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates a rolling calendar of campaigns that align to Sales leadership and Product pipeline goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivers a consistent experience for the Sales team with campaigns that are fully developed with content, lists, decks, and enablement to execute to plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represents the demand generation function in cross-departmental and external engagements and contributes directly to decisions that shape the direction of the area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentors colleagues across Marketing and partner teams, driving a culture of learning and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Marketing, Business, or related field; MBA or advanced degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in B2B marketing, with deep, recognized expertise and authority in demand generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success building and scaling demand generation programs in a high-growth SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of public safety or mission-driven technology markets is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead cross-functional initiatives and influence at all levels of the organization without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep mastery of marketing automation and analytics platforms (e.g., Marketo, SFDC), with experience establishing KPIs and reporting frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience owning CRO and market intelligence data governance, including establishing data quality standards, maintaining accurate account information, and partnering with Sales and Revenue Operations to drive data completeness, accuracy and continuous improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, analytical, and mentoring skills, with a record of raising the standard for the function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: T&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;his position requires a security clearance from the Government of Canada. Candidates must be legally authorized to work in Canada and must successfully obtain and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;a Reliability security clearance. Please note that specific customer contracts may impose&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;security verification requirements. Obtaining and&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;all required security clearances is a condition of employment. For more information on the Government of Canada&#39;s security screening process, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.canada.ca/en/public-services-procurement.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Public Services and Procurement Canada&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;. Additionally, d&lt;/span&gt;ue to the nature of our work with public safety agencies, this position may require compliance with the FBI&#39;s Criminal Justice Information Services (CJIS) Security Policy. Candidates must successfully pass a comprehensive, fingerprint-based background check. Please note that specific customer contracts may impose additional security verification requirements. Obtaining and maintaining all required security clearances is a condition of employment. For more information on CJIS security requirements, please visit the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fbi.gov/services/cjis/cjis-security-policy-resource-center&quot;&gt;FBI&#39;s CJIS Security Policy Resource Center&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Versaterm is committed to fair and equitable compensation that is competitive, consistent, and aligned with the value each role contributes to our organization. The starting salary for this position will be dependent upon many factors, such as the successful candidate’s skills, experience, education, training as well as internal equity, market data, and business needs. In addition to base salary and our comprehensive benefits offering, some roles may also be eligible for variable compensation such as incentive plans or discretionary performance bonuses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;For Ontario-based and British Columbia-based roles, the expected base salary range for this position is CAD $120,000 to $160,000 annually.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI is central to how Versaterm builds and delivers solutions for our customers. Within Talent Acquisition, we use AI-enabled tools to support certain aspects of the recruitment process, helping our team work more efficiently and spend more time connecting with great talent. AI supports our work, but all hiring and employment decisions are made by people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Versaterm is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to equity, diversity, inclusion, and a barrier-free workplace. Accommodations are available upon request throughout all stages of the recruitment process and apply to the terms and conditions of employment. For more information, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:peopleandculture@versaterm.com&quot;&gt;info@versaterm.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Questrade is on a mission to help Canadians to become much more financially successful and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For nearly 30 years, Questrade Financial Group has been delivering on that mission through investing, banking, mortgages, and real estate. Together, we tilt finance in favour of ambitious Canadians, creating new ways for them to seize the financial future they deserve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who are ready to enter their career inflection point. Mission-driven, exceptional folks that never settle. The work here is hard because the responsibility is real. If that&#39;s the standard you&#39;ve been looking for, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Req 4392&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The return on your career investment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation and incentives built to reward the value you bring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RRSP matching of up to 6%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellness resources and programs, including $5,000 in mental health practitioner coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$5,000 in tuition subsidies for job-related courses, every year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% parental top-up, up to 26 weeks for birthing parents and 18 weeks for non-birthing parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid environment, with at least three days in the office built for working together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid vacation, personal, and sick days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A community care day to give back to the causes you care about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;This job posting is for an existing vacancy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for our next Manager, Canadian Tax Reporting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Questrade Inc., has multiple client tax reporting obligations to various tax regulators, including the Canada Revenue Agency (CRA), and Ministère du Revenu du Québec (MRQ). In addition, there are also regulatory obligations to obtain sufficient documentation from the client to identify their tax residency.&amp;nbsp; Based on tax residency, withholding tax obligations must be met.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Senior Manager; the individual is expected to be the Subject Matter Expert (SME) on Canadian &amp;nbsp; taxation, and act as the central&amp;nbsp; and final point for all issues.&amp;nbsp; In addition, the individual is expected to review processes and documentation that affects client tax reporting and cost basis&amp;nbsp; to ensure applicability, completeness and accuracy, with a continuous improvement mindset, keeping a positive client experience front and center.&amp;nbsp; You will manage both Junior and Senior Analyst. &amp;nbsp; Your mission is to evolve manual workflows into scalable, automated processes while maintaining a culture of rigorous risk control and &quot;zero-error&quot; tolerance.&amp;nbsp; You will actively monitor service quality to mitigate risk, ensure maximum customer value, and maintain Questrade&#39;s reputation for Operational Excellence&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Mandate &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, responsibilities include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading and monitoring Canadian tax reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert Knowledge in preparing all or some of the following tax slips: T5, T3, T5013, NR4, T5008, T1135, 1099, 1042S, Realized Gain/Loss report, and/or K-1&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and monitoring XML filings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading&amp;nbsp; and monitoring tax season project plan, to ensure all regulatory deadlines are met or exceeded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading discussions to ensure accurate classification of securities and income for tax reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring timely and accurate remittance of payments to the CRA and MRQ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as the main point of contact with CRA and MRQ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading and monitoring daily tasks such as security and corporate action research, FX conversions, mail and email monitoring and distribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting and maintaining the reconciliation of internal tax remittance accounts with tax accounts with each regulator and ensuring discrepancies are resolved urgently and accurately.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting audits of client documentation to meet QI/FATCA/CRS requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in external and internal audits; define KPI, SLAs for team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing distribution of client tax reporting related cases, and ensures timely resolution, providing recommendations for complex issue resolution and appropriate process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending industry calls or conferences representing the firm, draft call memos and distribute to internal audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing and coaching team members on complex reorganization and entitlement events to determine taxable or non-taxable treatment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiating, leading and seeing through any ongoing project&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You’re ready for this mandate if you have the following qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have University or post-graduate degree related to finance or accounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 5+ years experience in client tax reporting, ideally within the brokerage industry&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 3+ years of experience in people leadership role strongly preferred, ideally with client tax reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are considered to be a SME in Canadian and/or US client tax reporting and filing processes (ideally both)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have knowledge of U.S. withholding certificates (e.g., W-9s, W-8s), and Qualified Intermediary requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have knowledge of FATCA and CRS reporting requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have working knowledge of dividends, income processing, reorg, registered plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have working experience with book of records and back-office operational systems and processes&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have Tax related courses, or industry designations such as CSC, CPA would be an asset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have knowledge of Broadridge BPS and TFP systems would be an asset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have knowledge of database queries (e.g. SQL), Microsoft Access,&amp;nbsp; and advanced Excel would be an asset; ability to work with large set of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Suite experience would be an asset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sounds like you? Click below to apply!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-DB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The final compensation package will be commensurate with the successful candidate&#39;s experience, skills, and geographic location (Canada). It includes a comprehensive benefits plan and a competitive incentive (bonus) program for Full-Time Permanent roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base salary range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology and AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We mix human ingenuity with advanced technology. For ambitious builders like you, we provide the latest technology to enable your creativity. You&#39;ll have everything you need to build the best outcomes and products for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Questrade Financial Group of Companies, we’re committed to fostering a diverse, inclusive, and accessible work environment where individuals are treated with dignity and respect. Our global team reflects the diversity of the communities we serve and operate in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accessibility statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates selected for an interview are contacted directly. If you require accommodation during the recruitment or selection process, please let us know. We will work with you to meet your needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in hiring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questrade Financial Group of companies Applicant Tracking System uses artificial intelligence (AI) for application screening. The AI system operates on predetermined criteria, with final decisions subject to human review.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POS-P2863&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As a Business Development Representative, your role is to seek out and engage “good fit” companies through strategic prospecting. To do this you will leverage HubSpot’s existing leads and generate new interest through calls, emails and social media messaging.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;When connecting with a prospect you will learn about their business challenges to determine whether HubSpot will serve as a solution. When you have identified a qualified prospect, your goal is to concisely communicate the value of HubSpot and gain interest in a deeper conversation with an Account Executive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will have a working relationship with 2-3 Account Executives. Each day you will collaborate with the Account Executives you support and your fellow BDRs to develop innovative strategies for uncovering new opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the responsibilities of a Business Development Representative?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will need to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Conduct high volume prospecting for qualified leads (new users and potential customers)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work closely and collaboratively with Account Executives to develop and implement appropriate prospect strategies and plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Schedule online product demonstrations for a qualified lead &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;whilst ensuring you meet your monthly goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Understand the customers’ needs and challenges using sales methodologies, i.e. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.hubspot.com/sales/bant#:~:text=BANT%20is%20a%20sales%20qualification,the%20product%2C%20and%20purchase%20timeline.&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BANT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Carry out market research to broaden the customer base of HubSpot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the role requirements?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The desire and commitment to be in Tech Sales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Sales/ prospecting experience and experience working in a high-growth, &quot;scale up&quot; environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A sharp focus on your goals and a strong approach for achieving them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The ability to deal and address objections, open to being coached&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong organizational and time management skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Passion for helping businesses grow and curiosity about the tech industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/hybrid&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; working policy that suits your working preference&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Amazing colleagues to learn from and having a mentor you can turn to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Interactive employee training and a month long onboarding experience to help you get started&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A clear career path with regular promotion tracks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;An education allowance up to €4,250 per year and a free books program so you can keep on learning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Unlimited paid vacation days on top of your annual 25 days paid time off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mental health coaching and sessions (Modern Health app) and other health benefits, ie Life Assurance, long term illness cover, fitness reimbursement of up to €250&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The cash compensation below includes base salary, on-target commission for employees in eligible roles, and annual bonus targets under HubSpot’s bonus plan for eligible roles. In addition to cash compensation, some roles are eligible to participate in HubSpot’s equity plan to receive restricted stock units (RSUs). Individual compensation packages are determined using objective, role-related criteria, which may include skills, experience, qualifications, and other job-related factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;This &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vi7Z3asrEMcTPARkWQdsA_xeayvzgw1t/view&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/a&gt; will help guide how we recommend thinking about the range you see.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Benefits are also an important piece of your total compensation package. Explore the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;benefits and perks&lt;/a&gt; HubSpot offers to help employees grow better.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;At HubSpot, fair compensation practices aren’t just about checking off the box for legal compliance. It’s about living out our value of transparency with our employees, candidates, and community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Cash Compensation Range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€45.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€61.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;At HubSpot, we value both flexibility and connection. Whether you’re a Remote employee or work from the Office, we want you to start your journey here by building strong connections with your team and peers. If you are joining our Engineering team, you will be required to attend a regional HubSpot office for in-person onboarding. If you join our broader Product team, you’ll also attend other in-person events, such as your Product Group Summit and other gatherings, to continue building on those connections.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;If you require an accommodation due to travel limitations or other reasons, please inform your recruiter during the hiring process. We are committed to supporting candidates who may need alternative arrangements&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HubSpot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HubSpot (NYSE: HUBS) is an AI-powered customer platform with all the software, integrations, and resources customers need to connect marketing, sales, and service. HubSpot&#39;s connected platform enables businesses to grow faster by focusing on what matters most: customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HubSpot, bold is our baseline. Our employees around the globe move fast, stay customer-obsessed, and win together. Our culture is grounded in four commitments: Solve for the Customer, Be Bold, Learn Fast, Align, Adapt &amp;amp; Go!, and Deliver with HEART. These commitments shape how we work, lead, and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a company&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/hybrid-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; where people can do their best work&lt;/a&gt;. We focus on brilliant work, not badge swipes. By combining clarity, ownership, and trust, we create space for big thinking and meaningful progress. And we know that when our employees grow, our customers do too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized globally for our award-winning culture by Comparably, Glassdoor, Fortune, and more, HubSpot is headquartered in Cambridge, MA, with employees and offices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
