&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Germany Applicants:&lt;/strong&gt; (m/f/d) - link to HubSpot&#39;s Career Diversity&amp;nbsp;page&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/diversity&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.hubspot.com/careers/diversity&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1642285588184000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3xxMKJX-6TTmbnyN6vYtUx&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;India&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Applicants:&lt;/strong&gt; link to HubSpot India&#39;s equal opportunity policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fTZ0ht2chl1WRI7Tgrbzh9ytZUhL2jG9/view?__hstc=20629287.8bedd818fefb24c6303ec98fcf9dcfff.1724281309795.1724281309795.1724281309795.1&amp;amp;__hssc=20629287.1.1724281309796&amp;amp;__hsfp=1818362978&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HubSpot may use AI to help screen or assess candidates, but all hiring decisions are always human. More information can be found&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/hiring-ai&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. By submitting your application, you agree that HubSpot may collect your personal data for recruiting, global organization planning, and related purposes. We may use CLEAR ID Verification during the hiring process to confirm your identity and help maintain a safe, secure, and trusted experience for all candidates. Refer to HubSpot&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://legal.hubspot.com/recruiting-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for details on data processing and your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;WHAT MAKES US EPIC?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the core of Epic’s success are talented, passionate people. Epic prides itself on creating a collaborative, welcoming, and creative environment. Whether it’s building award-winning games or crafting engine technology that enables others to make visually stunning interactive experiences, we’re always innovating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being Epic means being a part of a team that continually strives to do right by our community and users. We’re constantly innovating to raise the bar of engine and game development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;PROGRAMMING - EPIC RESEARCH&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Research conducts state-of-the-art research in machine learning, AI, character animation, and digital humans. We work with leading universities and product teams to bring new research into games like Fortnite, Unreal Engine, MetaHuman, and the tools creators use every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;MACHINE LEARNING RESEARCH INTERNSHIP AT EPIC GAMES&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games is looking for current PhD students and recent PhD graduates (within 12 months of graduation) for paid research internships, working on state-of-the-art machine learning across our ecosystem. Epic makes Unreal Engine, which powers creative work across many industries, alongside some of the world&#39;s most popular games, including Fortnite and Rocket League. Through these products, ML research at Epic reaches millions of creators and players every day. AI is reshaping the games industry, and Epic Research - led by Lucia Specia and Michael Black - is at the center of that shift. We&#39;re looking for talented interns who want to be part of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with our team of research scientists and programmers at the intersection of vision, language, speech processing, embodied agents, and game development to create state-of-the-art machine learning models in a range of areas - research topics of interest include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-backed interactive characters&lt;/strong&gt;: LLMs for conversational characters, memory&amp;nbsp;systems, automated evals, animation, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Game agents&lt;/strong&gt;: vision-language-action, game-state agents, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3D human and object tracking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reinforcement learning &lt;/strong&gt;for embodied behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speech systems and conversational agents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;World building and game logic generation&lt;/strong&gt;: video models, 2D-&amp;gt;3D scene building, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted game development&lt;/strong&gt;, e.g. the next generation of Epic Developer Assistant&amp;nbsp;for UE and UEFN&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embodied and physical intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; including human-object interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-modal diffusion models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Player safety&lt;/strong&gt;: AI-alignment, content moderation, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improved user experience&lt;/strong&gt;: personalised game recommendation, game representation,&amp;nbsp;spam detection, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content localization&lt;/strong&gt;: (multimodal) translation, quality assurance, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model distillation for realtime performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ongoing or recently completed (within the last 12 months) PhD in Computer Science, Mathematics, AI or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of publication in top conferences/journals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing deep learning algorithms for problems in computer vision, natural language processing, or speech/audio processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on knowledge of state-of-the-art ML methods, such as Transformers, diffusion models, and reinforcement learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with post-training foundation models, including SFT, preference training, and reinforcement learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent AI coding and experimental programming skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desirable: game development experience in either C++ or C#&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internship Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration&lt;/strong&gt;: 5-12 months initially (depending on your location), with flexible start-dates&amp;nbsp;throughout 2026/2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hours&lt;/strong&gt;: full-time (40 hours/week) or part-time (20 hours/week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Select regions within North America and Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Authorization: &lt;/strong&gt;You must hold an existing right to work in your given location for the full duration of the internship - visa sponsorship or support is unavailable for this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publishing&lt;/strong&gt;: Research by Epic interns is regularly published in top-tier conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This internship has a flexible start date in 2026/2027. Recruitment will be ongoing until teams find an ideal match. Applicants must be legally authorized to work in the posting location for the duration of the internship. For more information about Epic’s Early Career Program, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/earlycareers&quot;&gt;epicgames.com/earlycareers&lt;/a&gt;. This is going to be Epic!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games​ ​is a leading interactive entertainment company. For over 30 years we&#39;ve been making award-winning games and engine technology that empowers others to make visually stunning games and 3D content that bring environments to life like never before. Epic&#39;s award-winning Unreal Engine technology not only provides game developers the ability to build high-fidelity, interactive experiences for PC, console, mobile, and VR, it is also a tool being embraced by content creators across a variety of industries such as media and entertainment, automotive, and architectural design. As we continue to build our Engine technology and develop remarkable games, we strive to build teams of world-class talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Like what you hear? Come be a part of something Epic!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games deeply values diverse teams and an inclusive work culture, and we are proud to be an Equal Opportunity employer. Learn more about our Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/eeo-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note to Recruitment Agencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Epic does not accept any unsolicited resumes or approaches from any unauthorized third party (including recruitment or placement agencies) (i.e., a third party with whom we do not have a negotiated and validly executed agreement). We will not pay any fees to any unauthorized third party. Further details on these matters can be found &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/note-to-recruitment-agencies&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-document block-bidi&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8&quot;&gt;We are looking for an Executive Business Partner (EBP) to join our team. This is a hybrid role, reporting to the VP, EMEA Partner Ecosystem and VP, Worldwide Technology Alliances in the Channel department. In this strategic role, you will act as a proactive partner and operational multiplier, managing complex multi-timezone calendars, tracking regional budgets, and designing executive presentation decks. You will drive alignment across the leadership team and collaborate with the broader regional EA community to execute high-impact offsites and events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;584&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;622&quot;&gt;Act as the primary filter and operational proxy for executive leadership, making confident scheduling and business-critical decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;757&quot;&gt;Proactively manage complex calendars across diverse EMEA and US time zones to maintain alignment with high-priority commercial and partner goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;903&quot;&gt;Lead the end-to-end coordination of weekly Partner Leadership meetings, monthly All Hands, and management offsites, including building agendas and presenting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;Design, build, and refine high-impact presentation decks in Google Slides for internal and external business reviews&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1180&quot;&gt;Monitor and manage the regional Partner Ecosystem operational expense budget in coordination with Finance and track travel expenses in Concur&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1324&quot;&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. true ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1856&quot;&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2046&quot;&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback-knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2329&quot;&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and never stop developing yourself, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2544&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2595&quot;&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2768&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience supporting VP-level or SVP-level executives in a high-growth SaaS, technology, or multinational corporate environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2910&quot;&gt;Demonstrated expertise in managing high-volume international calendars, complex overseas travel itineraries, and time-zone coordination across EMEA, APJ, and the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3076&quot;&gt;Direct experience managing departmental operating budgets, corporate expense reporting, and purchasing workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3190&quot;&gt;Outstanding written, verbal, and interpersonal communication skills, including experience drafting executive communications and addressing large virtual audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3355&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3414&quot;&gt;Experience leveraging generative AI tools and scheduling automation software to optimize executive workflows, meeting summaries, and presentation design processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3578&quot;&gt;Prior experience supporting enterprise software sales, channel partnerships, or partner alliance teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3682&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience executing end-to-end corporate offsites, partner roundtables, or customer advisory boards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3792&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-LJ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Sales Engineer to join our team. This is a fully remote role based in Germany, reporting to the Sales Engineering Manager in the Solutions Consulting department. You will be a key technical driver in our mission, presenting the Zscaler cloud security platform to prospective customers and translating their goals into enticing, relevant recommendations. You’ll act as a trusted advisor, guiding clients through their transformational journey while delivering technical victories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present the Zscaler cloud security platform to prospective customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the vision and translate goals into enticing and relevant recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become the trusted advisor to our clients while aiding their transformational journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather customer technical requirements and promote the value proposition in POV, presentations, and demos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience as a Sales Engineer or Systems Integrator with deep knowledge of enterprise network or cloud security technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Value Selling Methodologies combined with proven experience partnering with sales to identify opportunities, build territory plans, and deliver proof of concept engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and experience producing high-impact presentations and demonstrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience demonstrating, positioning, or architecting AI-driven threat detection, automated policy generation, or predictive analytics within enterprise cloud security frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Platform certifications or other relevant credentials such as CISSP or CCNP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subject matter expertise in SASE, Proxy technology, Cybersecurity, IPS, DLP, CASB, or CNAPP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;#LI-LS2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roblox is seeking a Senior Compensation Business Partner supporting G&amp;amp;A, Design and Data Science functions who will be the subject matter expert and drive the broad-based and international compensation while ensuring Roblox&#39;s compensation is competitive, meaningful, performance-oriented, clearly communicated, and aligned with business priorities. This position is critical to delivering an exceptional portfolio of programs and services that inspire our employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the primary compensation partner for the functions they support to recruiting teams, HRBPs and business unit leaders by combining in-depth knowledge of compensation principles, understanding of the business and market landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop innovative compensation strategies to support the attraction and retention of top talent while reflecting market conditions, internal equity, a strong pay for performance philosophy and the company&#39;s priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and advice on comp related activities: new hire offers, analysis of recruiting data trends, promotions, transfers, international employees/contractors, performance calibrations &amp;amp; compensation, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a culture of continuous analytics and monitoring of current programs to find areas to improve and align with strategic priorities so that compensation is part of the proposition that can attract, engage, and retain top talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and conduct annual benchmarking of US and international jobs to ensure a great compensation package ranges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help implement all ongoing compensation programs and tools; provide leaders with deep insights to guide sound compensation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously review the current job architecture and systematic job leveling approach for the business that enables us to better support hiring, career growth, job evaluation ultimately leading to great compensation packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience with at least 8 years of corporate and/or consulting compensation-related experience ideally with some exposure to tech industry, showing progression and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial knowledge of compensation fundamentals: job matching, market pricing, Leveling and Job Architecture, equity mechanics at private and public companies, cyclical programs, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Sales Compensation Design, familiarity with designing and rolling out commission plans and knowledge on how these plans work in the technology industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working with large amounts of data, utilizing strong analytical skills to interpret compensation trends and build intelligence through reporting, with high attention to data validity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of industry trends and developments in compensation, including relevant legal issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence cross functional stakeholders effectively. Collaborate with diverse teams, communicate complex information clearly and concisely to a variety of audiences, build strong relationships with stakeholders, and influence decision-making through data-driven insights and persuasive communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentations skills, with the ability to effectively translate complex compensation concepts/models into digestible plans to the executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$209,130&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$244,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POS-34011&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager, Global Shared Services Quote-To-Cash&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: applications must be submitted in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HubSpot’s Quote-to-Cash team is a key operational team within the Finance organization that plays a critical role in supporting customers and internal HubSpot teams throughout the purchase, billing, and payment processes. HubSpot’s Finance organization runs the quote-to-cash and accounts payable processes that support customers and internal teams. We’re building a global shared services model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for our next exceptional people manager with a passion for developing others, building effective teams across sites, and helping us uphold and surpass our commitments to the customers we serve. If you have experience leading or coaching teams, a desire to help others, and a passion for driving a high-quality customer experience, this may be the right opportunity for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Manager, Global Shared Services QTC, you will lead daily operations, standardize processes, and build our shared services model across Bulgaria, India &amp;amp; Colombia, ensuring high-quality service delivery across centralized back-office functions. You will work closely with Quote to Cash and Accounts Payable leadership to build a team of specialists and coordinators who help our customers grow better and manage their inquiries, accounts receivable, accounts payable, cash, and all functions tied to the revenue management cycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are actively hiring for our new&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers-blog/hello-bulgaria-hubspot-is-opening-in-sofia&quot;&gt;Sofia office&lt;/a&gt;. Expectation will be to attend the office at least 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In this role, you’ll be responsible for:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the day-to-day QTC and AP operations for our scaled customer segment which will include reviewing AR aging reports, identifying high-risk accounts and ensuring timely collection, and overseeing invoice and payment processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing adherence to our customer facing and internal SLA’s across QTC and AP for scaled team and outsourcing function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing core KPIs and using data to drive core business decisions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading, coaching and developing team leads, specialists, and coordinators across sites with minimal supervision and able to manage through ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing AR and AP policies, collection strategies, forecasts, and long-term improvements across the order-to-cash and AP lifecycle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with Finance Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team to develop team roadmaps, create project plans, meet project deadlines, and ensure successful roll out of process changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with stakeholders to drive results and potential to absorb other operational processes from the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding HubSpot’s mission and core priorities, helping HubSpot processes scale and reduce customer friction in a compliant way, with strong controls across sites, while building our shared services operating model&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating with recruiting and internal teams to recruit, hire, and train new team members as the model grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to understand other viewpoints, and seeing your role in its larger context, tolerant with people and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;We are looking for people who:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are f&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;luent in English.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have excellent communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with managing complex teams/ multiple functions/ shared services across AR, billing, collections, cash application &amp;amp; AP in a global setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt quickly to the fast-paced environment of a high-growth SaaS business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience collaborating cross-functionally with stakeholders to drive results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have advanced Excel and data visualization software experience (Looker, Tableau, etc.) and Google Suite tools (Sheets, Slides, Docs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with, learning and incorporating AI technology to improve operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience building KPI’s/ metrics and supporting the analysis of data to drive streamlining of processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work and achieve results in a fast paced environment with minimal supervision, helping the team to make better decisions and avoid setbacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to understand other viewpoints, and seeing your role in its larger context, tolerant with people and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gives and seeks out feedback regularly. Seek to learn and grow continuously, ability to influence change and others without formal authority&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to roll-up your sleeves when work needs to get done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, self-starter, goal oriented, can work independently to identify process improvements and execute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong oral and written skills and the ability to communicate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work well with others, including as part of cross-functional teams and locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses good judgement and fosters DI&amp;amp;B in a team by building an inclusive team environment and meetings. Ensures everyone has an opportunity to share in the way they feel most comfortable. Ability to collaborate with global, cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The cash compensation below includes base salary, on-target commission for employees in eligible roles, and annual bonus targets under HubSpot’s bonus plan for eligible roles. In addition to cash compensation, some roles are eligible to participate in HubSpot’s equity plan to receive restricted stock units (RSUs). Individual compensation packages are determined using objective, role-related criteria, which may include skills, experience, qualifications, and other job-related factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;This &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vi7Z3asrEMcTPARkWQdsA_xeayvzgw1t/view&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/a&gt; will help guide how we recommend thinking about the range you see.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Benefits are also an important piece of your total compensation package. Explore the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;benefits and perks&lt;/a&gt; HubSpot offers to help employees grow better.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;At HubSpot, fair compensation practices aren’t just about checking off the box for legal compliance. It’s about living out our value of transparency with our employees, candidates, and community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Cash Compensation Range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€53.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€78.620 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;At HubSpot, we value both flexibility and connection. Whether you’re a Remote employee or work from the Office, we want you to start your journey here by building strong connections with your team and peers. If you are joining our Engineering team, you will be required to attend a regional HubSpot office for in-person onboarding. If you join our broader Product team, you’ll also attend other in-person events, such as your Product Group Summit and other gatherings, to continue building on those connections.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;If you require an accommodation due to travel limitations or other reasons, please inform your recruiter during the hiring process. We are committed to supporting candidates who may need alternative arrangements&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HubSpot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HubSpot (NYSE: HUBS) is an AI-powered customer platform with all the software, integrations, and resources customers need to connect marketing, sales, and service. HubSpot&#39;s connected platform enables businesses to grow faster by focusing on what matters most: customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HubSpot, bold is our baseline. Our employees around the globe move fast, stay customer-obsessed, and win together. Our culture is grounded in four commitments: Solve for the Customer, Be Bold, Learn Fast, Align, Adapt &amp;amp; Go!, and Deliver with HEART. These commitments shape how we work, lead, and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a company&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/hybrid-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; where people can do their best work&lt;/a&gt;. We focus on brilliant work, not badge swipes. By combining clarity, ownership, and trust, we create space for big thinking and meaningful progress. And we know that when our employees grow, our customers do too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized globally for our award-winning culture by Comparably, Glassdoor, Fortune, and more, HubSpot is headquartered in Cambridge, MA, with employees and offices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore more:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;HubSpot Careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeathubspot&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Life at HubSpot on Instagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need accommodations or assistance due to a disability, please reach out to us&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://form.asana.com/?k=Xr9-j19kRaY5T5NjIeyx4Q&amp;amp;d=8587152060687&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://form.asana.com/?k%3DXr9-j19kRaY5T5NjIeyx4Q%26d%3D8587152060687&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1699378163995000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2_XirAqwPzHwePk2ZYcL3q&quot;&gt;using this form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Germany Applicants:&lt;/strong&gt; (m/f/d) - link to HubSpot&#39;s Career Diversity&amp;nbsp;page&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/diversity&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.hubspot.com/careers/diversity&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1642285588184000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3xxMKJX-6TTmbnyN6vYtUx&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;India&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Applicants:&lt;/strong&gt; link to HubSpot India&#39;s equal opportunity policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fTZ0ht2chl1WRI7Tgrbzh9ytZUhL2jG9/view?__hstc=20629287.8bedd818fefb24c6303ec98fcf9dcfff.1724281309795.1724281309795.1724281309795.1&amp;amp;__hssc=20629287.1.1724281309796&amp;amp;__hsfp=1818362978&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HubSpot may use AI to help screen or assess candidates, but all hiring decisions are always human. More information can be found&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/hiring-ai&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. By submitting your application, you agree that HubSpot may collect your personal data for recruiting, global organization planning, and related purposes. We may use CLEAR ID Verification during the hiring process to confirm your identity and help maintain a safe, secure, and trusted experience for all candidates. Refer to HubSpot&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://legal.hubspot.com/recruiting-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for details on data processing and your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT ROCKET LAB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rocket Lab is the end-to-end space company building rockets, spacecraft, and critical subsystems that keep the world connected, protected, expand humanity’s reach to the Moon, Mars, and beyond. We move fast, build real hardware for meaningful missions, and make the impossible routine. Come shape the future with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Jl4-QdJ1Uac&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Rocket Lab is looking for an Avionics Project Engineer to join the Electron programme as we expand the vehicle&#39;s capabilities and increase our production and launch cadence. In this role, you&#39;ll plan, coordinate and deliver engineering changes to Electron&#39;s avionics hardware, from flight computers and harnesses to sensors and safety systems, ensuring they&#39;re introduced into production smoothly and on schedule.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working directly within the Avionics&amp;nbsp;Development engineering team, and closely with Supply Chain and Production, you&#39;ll own the configuration and master data for avionics assemblies, making sure every change is well scoped, resourced and executed to the quality standard required for 100% mission success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a role that suits someone who takes ownership of problems, is detail orientated, highly organised and comfortable moving fast across multiple concurrent projects.&amp;nbsp;Rocket Lab moves fast and change is constant. This is a rare opportunity that defines &#39;no two days are the same&#39;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Plan,&amp;nbsp;coordinate&amp;nbsp;and deliver engineering change projects for Electron&#39;s avionics hardware, from scoping through to production introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own schedule, resourcing and quality outcomes for assigned engineering changes, escalating risks early&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
