&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic understanding of avionics or electronics hardware, such as reading schematics or electrical systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
