&lt;ul data-start=&quot;26&quot; data-end=&quot;946&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;26&quot; data-end=&quot;109&quot; data-section-id=&quot;ac198e&quot;&gt;Build full-stack applications using modern technologies (frontend, backend, APIs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;171&quot; data-section-id=&quot;12wj60y&quot;&gt;Work on real client projects across a variety of industries&lt;/li&gt;
