&lt;li data-start=&quot;857&quot; data-end=&quot;946&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1sjt9q&quot;&gt;Participate in Agile ceremonies including standups, sprint planning, and retrospectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
